 "parts": [
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-001",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3101",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "user",
   "author_id": "con_tsl_rowan",
   "body": "Morning - Leo from our team sent you a note about seats. Yes, that's fine by me: please go ahead and take us down to 18 from the renewal. Nadia (Rowan Quay finance)",
   "created_at": "2026-11-13T09:12:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-002",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3101",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "admin",
   "author_id": "admin-tsl-arlo",
   "body": "Thanks Nadia, noted - the billing desk will pick this up with Leo's ticket.",
   "created_at": "2026-11-13T09:12:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-003",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3102",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "user",
   "author_id": "con_tsl_hollis",
   "body": "Can we export boards as PDF on Line? Dev",
   "created_at": "2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-004",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3102",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "admin",
   "author_id": "admin-tsl-arlo",
   "body": "Yes - PDF export is on every plan. Arlo",
   "created_at": "2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-005",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3103",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "user",
   "author_id": "con_tsl_saltmarsh",
   "body": "Do viewer links expire? Gwen",
   "created_at": "2026-11-06T11:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-006",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3103",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "admin",
   "author_id": "admin-tsl-arlo",
   "body": "No, viewer links stay live until you revoke them, and they never need a seat. Arlo",
   "created_at": "2026-11-06T11:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-007",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3104",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "user",
   "author_id": "con_tsl_gannet",
   "body": "Hi, how do I remove a member from the workspace? Imogen",
   "created_at": "2026-11-12T16:20:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-008",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3104",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "admin",
   "author_id": "admin-tsl-arlo",
   "body": "Settings > Members > Remove. Removing a member doesn't change your seat count on its own; the billing desk does that. Arlo",
   "created_at": "2026-11-12T16:20:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-009",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3105",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "user",
   "author_id": "con_tsl_fernhill",
   "body": "Does Line include review tools? Ines",
   "created_at": "2026-11-10T10:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-010",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3105",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "admin",
   "author_id": "admin-tsl-arlo",
   "body": "Review tools start on Grid. Line has boards, comments and shared libraries. Arlo",
   "created_at": "2026-11-10T10:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-011",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3106",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "user",
   "author_id": "con_tsl_inkwell",
   "body": "Can chat support refund a charge? Sasha",
   "created_at": "2026-11-12T15:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-012",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3106",
   "part_type": "comment",
   "author_type": "admin",
   "author_id": "admin-tsl-arlo",
   "body": "Refunds are handled by Finance - the billing desk will pass your request on. Arlo",
   "created_at": "2026-11-12T15:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "part-tsl-013",
   "conversation_id": "conv-tsl-3107",
